  {
    "name": "lookup_content",
    "description": "Browse cars or tracks, resolve up to 50 unique IDs, or filter names/configuration with a case-insensitive substring. IDs and query are exclusive. Sorted by ID; continue with cursor alone. No assets or prices.",
